    "data": [
        {
            "title": "摩根大通剛對比特幣作出大膽預測 你應買入嗎？",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"摩根大通剛對比特幣作出大膽預測 你應買入嗎？\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"504\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/448c46755cb2f6332f2805ead8cef6900c4f31d9147ebbc7501d276a81a64b3c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhk_moneyclub_713%2Fe4bfc97b74c2d1a01cc6fbdc0ee70c73.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">摩根大通剛對比特幣作出大膽預測 你應買入嗎？</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在2026年10月發布的2027長綫資本市場假設報告中，摩根大通預測比特幣（BTC）未來十年每年回報10%，對比其對大型美股7.5%的預測。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這判斷可被視為對比特幣非常悲觀——遠低於過去四年43.9%的複合年增長率（CAGR）；亦可視為樂觀——意味着它將在相當長時期跑贏銀行建模的每一個主要資產類別。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在此框架下，你應買入這枚幣並持有至銀行預測期結束嗎？</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\">比特幣收益預期伴隨大量波動</h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">摩根大通預期比特幣年波動55%，大型美股僅18%。兩個數字大致與歷史數據一致。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-1096c259-133a-3035-9010-51791d633aea-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">用摩根大通對這枚幣相對股票的估計前瞻回報，兩者每單位波動賺取的高於持有現金的回報同為0.32點。這暗示銀行並不真正相信比特幣會有高於股票的波動調整後回報，只是比特幣較高預期回報伴隨成比例更高的風險。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">潛台詞是：若你無法承受投資價值大幅擺動，即使最終回報更高，持有比特幣對你也不會愉快。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">預測核心因素是比特幣新開採供應隨時間收縮，對比全球貨幣供應大致擴張。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">摩根大通稱這枚幣為「投機資產及對貨幣寬鬆的對冲」，意味着它是風險資產，傾向在央行擴大貨幣供應時表現良好。這大致吻合；雖然這枚幣尚未證明是有效通脹對冲，但其嚴格有限供應及無法以法令增印，應意味着購買力隨時間繼續站得住。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\">值得持有多少比特幣？</h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">按摩根大通，這是該報告系列首次納入比特幣回報預測。它仍未建議配置比例。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">不過，它預期比特幣未來十年跑贏股票。因此，一旦你的傳統組合已充分分散，至少持有一點值得。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">至於買多少，BlackRock於2024年12月發現，在傳統60/40股債組合中配置2%比特幣，已佔總風險5%；配置4%則佔14%。另一方面，Morgan Stanley於2025年底建議，最進取組合在該資產最多持4%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這主張多數投資者配置少於5%——記住，若這枚幣固有波動會令你失眠，配置應瞄準該區間較淺一端。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">作者：Alex Carchidi, The Fool</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文刊登於 <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"HKMoneyClub\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:HKMoneyClub;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.hkmoneyclub.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">HKMoneyClub</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">更多你或感興趣內容：</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"美光股價：現在應獲利了結還是加碼？\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:美光股價：現在應獲利了結還是加碼？;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.hkmoneyclub.com/2026/10/28/%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%89%E8%82%A1%E5%83%B9%EF%BC%9A%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%87%89%E7%8D%B2%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%86%E7%B5%90%E9%82%84%E6%98%AF%E5%8A%A0%E7%A2%BC%EF%BC%9F/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">美光股價：現在應獲利了結還是加碼？</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"若2027年前只能買一隻AI股我會選這隻\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:若2027年前只能買一隻AI股我會選這隻;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.hkmoneyclub.com/2026/10/11/%e8%8b%a52027%e5%b9%b4%e5%89%8d%e5%8f%aa%e8%83%bd%e8%b2%b7%e4%b8%80%e9%9a%bbai%e8%82%a1%e6%88%91%e6%9c%83%e9%81%b8%e9%80%99%e9%9a%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">若2027年前只能買一隻AI股我會選這隻</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\